  "terrainName": "village-street",
  "description": "What: the doctrine's platoon attack on a machine-gun position, on the real town streets (village-street). 'Red MG Team' (Hostile: a PKM gunner and two riflemen) defends the three-storey house at (530,228) on the south side of the main street (y 255), its arc west down the street (SquadDefend, house defence: window posts). 'Blue Platoon' (Friend, 3 squads of 4) attacks it from 150 m west (PlatoonAttack on the house): a base of fire suppresses the gun from the houses at x 437-499 while an assault squad goes round by the back gardens south of the street (or the side street at x 550) and takes the house from its flank. Judge (240 s, doctrine ATP 3-21.8 / ATP 3-06.11): nobody stands in the middle of the street; the men keep to the house walls; the base of fire puts rounds on the gun; the assault reaches the gun from the side; the gun is silenced. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh village-street-mg-flank. 📄 docs/blueprints/batches/REPORT_Behaviors_Village_Street_Fight.md"
 },
